{"3514000":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crazy Life","steam_appid":3514000,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5336470],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Overview<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crazy Life<\/i> is a <strong>multiplayer, board-game-style life simulation<\/strong> that can be played by up to six players.       <br>       <br><strong><i>Rules<\/i><\/strong>       <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is turn-based, with one turn representing one in-game year.        <br>When the game ends, the player with the highest total assets wins.        <br>Players spin a roulette wheel to determine their movement and trigger different events depending on the space they land on.       <br>       <br><strong><i>Types of space<\/i> <\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>※<\/strong>This image is from the Japanese version, but the full English version will be available in the final release.<strong> <\/strong> <br><strong><i>Card acquisition space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/07bf355bd556dd9f3ec866b9a59150a7.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can obtain one random card out of 60 different types.<br>Using the cards you’ve collected allows you to gain advantages and change the flow of the game.<br><br><strong><i>Card purchase space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/ead907557bbba4d51b2dc122bee16034.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase selected cards <br> <br><strong><i>money space<\/i> <\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/35d4ec9bf4b69be5f28739512b7832a6.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events can increase or decrease your money.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Job change space<\/i><\/strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/e06df12adb6a5c63c4672575086f7ab1.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/e06df12adb6a5c63c4672575086f7ab1.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/sha