evel<strong>.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you pass a Payday Space, a “Payday” is counted.   <br>At the end of your turn, all counted “Paydays” are consumed and your salary is paid.   <br>If you land exactly on a Payday Space, your salary is doubled.   <br>   <br><strong><i>Marriage space (Before Marriage)<\/i> <\/strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/08e38123f39618d7ee0f51fb190e0ddf.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get married by increasing your relationship level with a character you’ve exchanged contact information with.<br>Characters of higher rarity have <strong>unique abilities<\/strong> that can give you powerful advantages during the game.<br><br><strong><i>Marriage space (After Marriage)<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.poster.avif?t=1792629269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.webm?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3514000\/extras\/3439c004415ebaee59a9d2e06385dc85.mp4?t=1792629269\" type=\"video\/mp4\">